  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As magic flows through your body, it causes physical traits of your dragon ancestors to emerge. Your hit point maximum increases by 3 and increases by 1 again whenever you gain a level in this class.</p><p>Additionally, parts of your skin are covered by a thin sheen of dragon-like scales. When you aren't wearing armor, your AC equals 10 + your Dexterity modifier + your Charisma modifier.</p>",
